&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;yui-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1762&quot;&gt;SCP-CN-1762——处女作&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;真的……回家了吗？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1815&quot;&gt;SCP-CN-1815&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;这只鸟看上去怪怪的。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/never-back&quot;&gt;再也回不去了&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;已是孤家寡人。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/transmigration&quot;&gt;轮回&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;自嫌双泪下，不是解空人。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1844&quot;&gt;SCP-CN-1844&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“不知道真相对他们来说是一种残忍。”&lt;br /&gt;
“但对于特定的人来说，沉浸在虚幻的乐土决非坏事。”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-1&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4095&quot;&gt;SCP-4095 爱你——翻译处女作&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“简短，却又暖心。”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4267&quot;&gt;SCP-4267 烟道不通&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;一道烟囱，错综复杂的通道后藏着什么？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4247&quot;&gt;SCP-4247 普通的Bob&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bob不值得被人铭记。&lt;sub&gt;Bob很孤单。&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1674&quot;&gt;SCP-1674 暗箱&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;简单的原理，造就的是身处异乡却无法回家的悲剧。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1789&quot;&gt;SCP-1789 愤怒的手指&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;此篇由&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972&quot; alt=&quot;Ora_Spring&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring&quot;  &gt;Ora_Spring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;、&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-best-hunter&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4761736&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972&quot; alt=&quot;The best hunter&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4761736)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-best-hunter&quot;  &gt;The best hunter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 合译&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;待所谓主宰如同朝圣者。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4268&quot;&gt;SCP-4268 驱逐&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;失踪的人，会动的木雕，背后的真的仅是驱逐吗？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/old:scp-4456&quot;&gt;SCP-4456——旧页面&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;食物链顶端的存在……的确是。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4376&quot;&gt;SCP-4376 你有尝试过多笑笑吗？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;抑郁症，双躯者。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3558&quot;&gt;SCP-3558 眼睑切除器&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;切除眼睑，视为己任。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-80-k-j&quot;&gt;SCP-80-K-J 鸡军&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;content-panel standalone&quot; style=&quot;font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;勉强算作是军事单位的小鸡……军团？提出的要求都很奇怪。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
