&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hbkouki&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6083676&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972&quot; alt=&quot;HBkouki&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6083676)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hbkouki&quot;  &gt;HBkouki&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
这css太棒了！&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rain-ze&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6132896&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972&quot; alt=&quot;rain ze&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6132896)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rain-ze&quot;  &gt;rain ze&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
