&lt;p&gt;肥肠感谢&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/copperia&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5310502&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972&quot; alt=&quot;copperia&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5310502)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/copperia&quot;  &gt;copperia&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;提供的CSS代码！肥肠感谢！&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;谁喜欢铜锈我们就是异父异母的兄弟。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
