					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="class:desktop-only; position:fixed; RIGHT: 10pt; BOTTOM: 10pt; display: inline-block; float:top; padding:0 0 0 0; overflow: auto"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">有兴趣听首歌么？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">那么......为君呈现于此。</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>若是这般无星，无月，无光。</p> <p><iframe frameborder="no" border="0" marginwidth="0" marginheight="0" width="330" height="86" src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com//music.163.com/outchain/player?type=2&id=31179004&auto=0&height=66"></iframe></p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div id="wiki-tabview-b447b024aae3a5c5ccd483361fc36e51" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>原创内容</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>翻译内容</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>个人资料</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>留言板</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>自检用</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>一些话</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1762">SCP-CN-1762——处女作</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>真的……回家了吗？</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1815">SCP-CN-1815</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>这只鸟看上去怪怪的。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/never-back">再也回不去了</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>已是孤家寡人。</p> </div> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/transmigration">轮回</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>自嫌双泪下，不是解空人。</p> </div> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1844">SCP-CN-1844</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>“不知道真相对他们来说是一种残忍。”<br /> “但对于特定的人来说，沉浸在虚幻的乐土决非坏事。”</p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4095">SCP-4095 爱你——翻译处女作</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>“简短，却又暖心。”</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4267">SCP-4267 烟道不通</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>一道烟囱，错综复杂的通道后藏着什么？</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4247">SCP-4247 普通的Bob</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>Bob不值得被人铭记。<sub>Bob很孤单。</sub></p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1674">SCP-1674 暗箱</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>简单的原理，造就的是身处异乡却无法回家的悲剧。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1789">SCP-1789 愤怒的手指</a><br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>此篇由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span>、<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-best-hunter" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4761736&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="The best hunter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4761736)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-best-hunter" >The best hunter</a></span> 合译</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>待所谓主宰如同朝圣者。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4268">SCP-4268 驱逐</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>失踪的人，会动的木雕，背后的真的仅是驱逐吗？</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/old:scp-4456">SCP-4456——旧页面</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>食物链顶端的存在……的确是。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4376">SCP-4376 你有尝试过多笑笑吗？</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>抑郁症，双躯者。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3558">SCP-3558 眼睑切除器</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>切除眼睑，视为己任。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-80-k-j">SCP-80-K-J 鸡军</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>勉强算作是军事单位的小鸡……军团？提出的要求都很奇怪。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/dining-out">下馆子</a><br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>此篇由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span>、<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r-allen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5663983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="R Allen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5663983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r-allen" >R Allen</a></span> 合译</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>“无论如何，希望这对所有特工、研究员和其他工作人员来说都是一个教训，不要随意滥用双关语，以防一些未被收容的SCP-504的存在。”</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4574">SCP-4574 旧石器时代的矛虎</a><br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>此篇由<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span>、<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r-allen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5663983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="R Allen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5663983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/r-allen" >R Allen</a></span> 合译</p> </div> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>此世虽已身死，来世仍做兄弟。</p> </div> <br /> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-last-meeting">最后一场会议</a> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>禹禹独行冰雪中，逢旧雨，重临昔日伤心地。<br /> 故人反目陷囹圄，久初觉，不过幻梦一场空。</p> </div> <br /> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/compromised">妥协</a> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>看似局已定，实则胜负未可知。</p> </div> <br /> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/crunch-is-a-beautiful-sound">脖子被折断的声音再美妙不过</a> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>寂静将会降临，没有人能够接近真相。</p> </div> <br /> <br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5399">SCP-5399 一只小嗡嗡</a> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>烦人的臭苍蝇。</p> </div> <p><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5023">SCP-5023 人类原始冲动</a></p> <div class="content-panel standalone" style="font-family: Courier New, Courier, monospace; width: auto; padding: 10px 30px; margin: 20px auto; background: url(http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/sirens-sandbox-3/local--files/sirens-sandbox-2/folder.jpg) repeat; text-shadow: 0.5px 0.5px 0.5px rgba(0,0,0,.25)"> <p>破坏欲。</p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/ora-spring-s-personnel-file/%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%BE1"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ora-spring-s-personnel-file/%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%BE1/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="人设1" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>Dr. Ora，摄于Site-CN-03。</p> </div> </div> <p><strong>姓名：</strong>Ora/玄泉</p> <p><strong>性别：</strong>女</p> <p><strong>常驻站点：</strong>Site-CN-03、Site-CN-19、Site-CN-09</p> <p><strong>简介：</strong>Ora的具体年龄本人并未透露，身高约164厘米，体重约84斤。平时沉默寡言，常被同事调侃过于害羞。喜欢于工作时穿着基金会下发的白大褂工作服。</p> <p>Ora擅长生物研究方面，此外，她还拥有基础的医疗救护知识。其格外不擅长理科，尤其是数学。</p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/ora-spring-s-personnel-file/%E6%AD%A3%E4%BD%93"><img src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ora-spring-s-personnel-file/%E6%AD%A3%E4%BD%93/medium.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="正体" class="image" /></a> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>据说这才是正体诶（？）</p> </div> </div> </div> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <p>如你所见，你可以在这里留下你想说的话。<br /></p> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 噫！我抢到沙发力（狂喜<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/blinking-dm" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2988659&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="blinking DM" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2988659)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/blinking-dm" >blinking DM</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 是大佬，太强了（混乱）。<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="error-inline"><em>EveTerminus</em> 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名</span></p> </div> <br /> 處女作就+50分，太厲害了！請收下我的膝蓋！<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wupaispanda" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5223229&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Wupaispanda" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5223229)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wupaispanda" >Wupaispanda</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 人设图我推爆，卡哇伊角色大爱<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">就好比萝莉</span>。<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mioball-one" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3986116&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Mioball-One" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3986116)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mioball-one" >Mioball-One</a></span></p> </div> <br /> CSS我吹爆，给人一种绚烂的体验<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ctorjschen" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4530800&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="CTorJSChen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4530800)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ctorjschen" >CTorJSChen</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 玄泉人设真可爱，<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">我能睡她吗</span><br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/copperia" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5310502&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="copperia" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5310502)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/copperia" >copperia</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>显然不能。 ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>给老子爬。 ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fomal" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4681073&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Fomal" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4681073)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fomal" >Fomal</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: left;"> <p>所以玄泉是男是女？<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">那么可爱无所谓</span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xkong-ggggg" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5573535&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Xkong ggggg" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5573535)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xkong-ggggg" >Xkong ggggg</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: left;"> <p>终于找到您的人事页了，玄泉前辈！</p> </div> <br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vodka-wells" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5721026&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Vodka Wells" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5721026)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vodka-wells" >Vodka Wells</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 玄泉什么时候vtb出道<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">给我们爽爽啊（指传播写文技巧）</span><br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kyubi-duck" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5437364&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Kyubi_Duck" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5437364)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kyubi-duck" >Kyubi_Duck</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 玄泉，永远滴神<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">我永远喜欢玄泉先辈</span><br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luo-chen-c" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5154480&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="luo chen C" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5154480)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/luo-chen-c" >luo chen C</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 我永远爱玄泉（确信）<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-f" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5712643&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Just F" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5712643)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-f" >Just F</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 这页面，爱了爱了！<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hbkouki" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6083676&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="HBkouki" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6083676)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hbkouki" >HBkouki</a></span></p> </div> <br /> 这css太棒了！<br /> <div style="text-align: right;"> <p>——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rain-ze" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6132896&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="rain ze" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6132896)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rain-ze" >rain ze</a></span></p> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"></div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <p>肥肠感谢<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/copperia" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5310502&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="copperia" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5310502)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/copperia" >copperia</a></span>提供的CSS代码！肥肠感谢！</p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">谁喜欢铜锈我们就是异父异母的兄弟。</span></p> <p>人设出自：<a href="https://picrew.me/image_maker/221801">https://picrew.me/image_maker/221801</a> ， 遵守CC协议。</p> <p>正体一图由本人自行绘制。</p> </div> </div> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <h1><span>咕咕，咕咕咕！</span></h1> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511972" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span></p> 
