44%2063.75%2077.425781%2061.992188%2080.792969%2060.332031%20C%2083.875%2058.816406%2086.390625%2057.882812%2089.574219%2057.089844%20C%2091.976562%2056.492188%2095.234375%2055.941406%2096.523438%2055.925781%20L%2097%2055.917969%20Z%20M%2097%2065.582031%20%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E&quot;);"></div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>.<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> <strong>姓名</strong>：Creeper</p> <p><strong>安全等级</strong>：CN站点4级权限</p> <p><strong>职务</strong>：研究员</p> <p><strong>就职站点</strong>：Site-CN-57</p> <strong>个人资料</strong>： <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">来者谁人也</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">我！你吃了吗</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><span style="color: black">加载中&#8230;</span></p> <p><span style="font-size:150%;"><span class="fa fa-spinner fa-pulse fa-spin" style="color: black"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&nbsp;</span></span></span><br /> .<br /> .<br /> .<br /> .</p> <blockquote> <p><strong>发生错误</strong><br /> <strong>错误代码：403</strong><br /> 推荐解决方法：重试<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-966541-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup></p> </blockquote> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>外貌特征</strong>：研究员Creeper的典型外貌特征为络腮胡，具有银白色的瞳孔，形成原因未知。在一次异常事件后，研究员Creeper的表皮开始不断生长鳞片，这种症状最严重区域的鳞片厚度达2cm，但目前已停止生长。</p> <p><strong>简介</strong>：研究员Creeper为一名身高约1.83米的汉族男性，典型衣着打扮为牛仔裤及灰色羊毛衫，并因其对冷兵器使用的精通和随身佩戴一把唐刀的习惯而为人所知<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-966541-2" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >2</a></sup>。因研究员Creeper对SCP-2308等SCP<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-966541-3" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >3</a></sup>的熟悉，在基金会CN分部内有传言称Creeper在加入基金会前曾为普罗米修斯实验室工作，有关该传言的真伪目前正在调查。</p> <p>由于研究员Creeper的个人喜好，其的办公室内有如下物品：</p> <ul> <li>一本线装版《中庸》，由软笔手工书写。</li> <li>一套茶具。</li> <li>一盘象棋</li> <li>冷兵器，包括弓、刀、剑等。</li> </ul> <p><br /> <br /></p> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">箭矢无声，谁人当存于世</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">我怎么可能知道</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><strong>翻译SCP文档</strong></p> <hr /> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5028">SCP-5028</a><br /> <span style="font-size:60%;"><em>标题：安普利亚流亡者</em></span><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5046">SCP-5046</a><br /> <span style="font-size:60%;"><em>标题：生机图钉</em></span><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5152">SCP-5152</a><br /> <span style="font-size:60%;"><em>标题：身虽死，痛仍存</em></span><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4210">SCP-4210</a><br /> <span style="font-size:60%;"><em>标题：美国之梦</em></span><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-4984">SCP-4984</a><br /> <span style="font-size:60%;"><em>标题：记忆菌丝体</em></span></p> </div> </div> </div> <hr /> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">个人荣誉一览</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">其实也没什么</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8%E6%98%8E.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8F%82%E5%8A%A0%E8%A1%A8