						 <div class="nightskyScreen" style="width:90%;height:200px;margin:auto;"> <div class="starBackScreen"></div> <div class="starBackScreen3"></div> <div class="ufo"></div> </div> <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div style="display:none"><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--files/nav%3Aside/styleFrame.html?bhl" name="typeFrame"></iframe></div> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><br /></p> <div id="wiki-tabview-aed272ee2d71cb5a7134707cc2728ce8" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>个人资料</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>研究项目</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>艺作（确信）</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>留言板（都来这里留个言吧！）</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <p><strong>姓名：</strong>林██</p> <p><strong>代号：</strong>鸽子/Fish King/摸鱼王/并曾叫“Virtues”，于2020年6月11日凌晨突发奇想改了个名。</p> <p><strong>性别：</strong>男</p> <p><strong>年龄：</strong>【数据损坏】</p> <p><strong>出生年月：</strong>【数据损坏】</p> <p><strong>国籍：</strong>中国</p> <p><strong>职位：</strong>Site-CN-09研究人员</p> <p><strong>常驻站点：</strong>Site-CN-09</p> <p><strong>安保权限：</strong>3级</p> <p><strong>简介：</strong>林██，无党派人士，感性人，因为生活的不顺经常在深夜一个人自怨自艾，需严加看管以免作出对基金会财产进行损坏的行为。希望能有人多陪他说两句话，然后感到无聊时会去缠着别人说个不停，超级烦人，于20██加入基金会，下叙于2020年被派往Site-CN-09，上叙是个很多古怪点子而又很少动手写的屑人。</p> <p>上叙是个除了和别人出去玩不然平时保持鸡窝头的小眼睛男生，下叙是个染了一头白发的正太（？）二级现实扭曲者，因为身材娇小而且头发因为长久没有修剪一直垂到腰间经常被误认为是女孩子，经常穿着一身与自己娇小的身体不符的宽松的白大褂，总觉得不够睡所以经常打哈欠而且迟到早退，但大家都不会怪他的对吧？</p> <p>上叙是个写作功力不够但还是偏要写所以现在都是低创混日子的屑人，下叙是个整天摸鱼然后等到年底冲业绩（？）的时候快速摸出几份低质量文档的屑研究员，最大的梦想是能够平平安安快快乐乐的过一辈子然后如果可以的话能约上几个好友一起出去旅行，然而只达成了“平平安安”这一目标，想着努力工作就可以赚够钱出去旅游然而没想到基金会不发工资只发卫生纸。</p> <p>和<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scrantoncaspar326" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6208431&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511984" alt="ScrantonCaspar326" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6208431)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scrantoncaspar326" >ScrantonCaspar326</a></span>，<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4400843&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511984" alt="Ora_Spring" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4400843)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ora-spring" >Ora_Spring</a></span>一个宿舍，<span style="text-decoration: line-through;">目前是充当宿舍内rbq一职</span><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">玄泉是被绑架到这里来的</span>（别问站点不同是怎么睡一起的，问就是空间折叠）</p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;稍微自嗨一下应该不要紧吧（）</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;（）</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>统治着平行宇宙里的鸽子帝国，是个强大的黑型，在公元2211年把所有生物都转化成了鸽子，SCP基金会变成了保护鸽子协会，那只万恶的蜥蜴也被变成了可爱的鸽子，那个球体（球？你说什么球）被变成了鸽子雕塑，是伟大的鸽子王！</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1472">SCP-CN-1472</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1823">SCP-CN-1823</a><br /> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1391">SCP-CN-1391</a></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-2" style="display:none"> <p><strong>下面是社恐笨蛋色离子画的超——可——爱——人设表情包</strong></p> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023148.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023148.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023143.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023143.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023138.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023138.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023133.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023133.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023127.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023127.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023122.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023122.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023116.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023116.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023110.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023110.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023105.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023105.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023100.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023100.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023053.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023053.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023048.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023048.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023042.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023042.jpg" class="image" /><br /> <img src="http://scpsandboxcn.wikidot.com/local--files/tupianfangzheliyo/QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023031.jpg" alt="QQ%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%8720200611023031.jpg" class="image" /> <div style="text-align: right;"></div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-3" style="display:none"> <p>抢占首评！——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/josephjoestar" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6159447&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511984" alt="JosephJoestar" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6159447)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/josephjoestar" >JosephJoestar</a></span><br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">↑什？）老东西家住基金会的吗</span>默默的建起一座核电站（——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-jotaro" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6277235&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511984" alt="the Jotaro" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6277235)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/the-jotaro" >the Jotaro</a></span><br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">勉强能冲。</span>发来核电。——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vastrode" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6251754&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511984" alt="Vastrode" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6251754)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/vastrode" >Vastrode</a></span><br /> <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">诶好耶是正太我太可以了</span> ——<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/xolowithsinnine" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4418499&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609511984" alt="xOLowithSinnine" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4418499)" /></a><a href="http:/